					<td class="catbg" colspan="3">
						Started by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=188">Jamae Morteamor</a> | Last post by <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202">xaanru</a>
